    "body": "### What is the user problem or growth opportunity you want to see solved?\nCurrently deleting all browsing history won't delete logins. Since logins do have website information, this might leak private data. It would be great if we had a logins option in delete browsing data\n\n### How do you know that this problem exists today? Why is this important?\nAs a user, I want to be able to delete all user data from within the app, or on a granular scale\n\n### Who will benefit from it?\nPeople who frequently delete browsing data\n\n┆Issue is synchronized with this [Jira Task](https://mozilla-hub.atlassian.net/browse/FNXV2-6980)\n",
